  "configuration_id": "config_002",
  "reason": "The existing evidence shows RNA-only PCA singleprofile is much stronger than image-only ResNet singleprofile (48.5% vs 20.8% validation accuracy), but it is still unclear whether using multiple profiles adds useful signal or whether simple aggregation is sufficient. config_002 keeps the proven PCA RNA representation and changes only the profile setting to multiprofile with avgpool, directly testing the effect of multiprofile aggregation. Under a limited budget, this is a focused, low-risk extension of the current best direction and avoids confounding changes in modality, RNA encoder, or fusion."
}

